From df1fba9fb52e8432db3d8a8cdca05d8a43bacfa1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:18:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] text button placeholders: reserved glyph bitmaps recognised
 by the texture replacement and drawn as the input style's icon

ga2_text_icons.h (generated by tools/modding/make_text_icons.py header) holds
25 monochrome 24x24 PSMT4 glyphs for the reserved characters 0xF040+; gs_texpacks.cpp
hashes them like any sampled region and replaces a hit with the current style's
icon (1 or 2 cells, 4x). GA2_BUTTONS_CYCLE=<s> steps the prompt style on a timer
(test aid), GA2_NO_TEXT_ICONS=1 turns the replacement off. Tests: 613 pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
